    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Why do diamond tools need dressing?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>A diamond-coated tool becomes dull over time and can get clogged with built-up debris. A tool dressing machine removes deposits on grinding surfaces and the spaces between the diamond coating, which improves precision and extends the tool’s life. </p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c164726",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How often should tools be dressed?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Tools must be regularly reground/resharpened, typically after 150-210 meters of machining for larger wheels and 90–150 meters for sink tools.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c164728",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Will dressing reduce tooling costs?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Yes, tool dressing reduces tooling costs by extending the service life of your tools by 40–50 %.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c164730",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What if I have both HSK and ISO 40 tool holding?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The <strong>»</strong>conDress<strong>«</strong> has changeable adapters to support both HSK and ISO 40. </p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c164732",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
